# Claude Code local state. settings.local.json is one machine's permission
# grants -- home directory layout, unrelated repo paths, local MCP plugins --
# and this repository is public. It was tracked until 2026-08-31; nothing in
# it was ever a secret, but none of it belongs here either, and the CI job
# loads `local` as a settings source, so it was shipping a laptop's
# additionalDirectories to a runner that has no such directories.
.claude/settings.local.json
